  "goodToKnow": "Der Missstand is an abuse, grievance or deplorable state of affairs: Missstände aufdecken, anprangern, beseitigen. It's typical of investigative reporting and politics: Missstände in der Fleischindustrie led to new labour laws in 2021. Since the spelling reform, it's written with three s (Missstand), one of several triple-letter words like Schifffahrt. The prefix miss- means wrong: missverstehen, Misserfolg. Plural: die Missstände."
